//
// One of THREE Model Broker services (Router + Gateway + Classifier).
// LOCKED Tier 2 D6: NEVER fold these three into a single binary (god-object reject).
//
// Classifier responsibility: small-model fuzzy classification used by the
// Router when deterministic rules are ambiguous (~10% of traffic). NOT the
// default routing path.
//
// LLM-as-router is explicitly REJECTED (Tier 2 D6). Fuzzy routing uses a
// fine-tuned Gemma 4 classifier HEAD, not a generative LLM. The Classifier
// owns its own ML lifecycle (training, registry, A/B, drift detection).
//
// Hot-path: Autopilot Pod + GPU, min replicas >= 1 (low-latency calls from Router).
// Cold-path: Cloud Run + GPU (batch / drift / async).
// p50 latency target: 5-15ms on hot-path. mTLS via Cloud Service Mesh.
// =============================================================================

